OL,3,ABrazil's left-wing President Lula wins
OL,4,Afourth term but rival Flavio Bolsonaro
OL,5,Arejects result
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazil's left-wing President Lula wins
OL,8,Fa fourth term in office, defeating his
OL,9,Fright-wing challenger Flavio Bolsonaro
OL,10,F- here's how he did it
OL,12,FThe 80-year-old, who took just under
OL,13,F52% in the run-off vote, now faces a
OL,14,Fhostile Congress and divided country
OL,16,FBolsonaro - who won the first round -
OL,17,Fsays the result is "inexplicable" and
OL,18,Fcalls for it to be annulled, a
OL,19,Fsupporter says he was "more than
OL,20,Fupset". Our Latin America editor
OL,21,Fexplains what's happening
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
